profile.cov

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# What `agnos exec-test` writes while it runs an example: the tree the example
# produced and the copy it asserts. The golden result.yaml beside them is
# committed; these two are rebuilt from scratch on every run.
examples/*/*/TestDir/
examples/*/*/AssertDir/

# `agnos compile`
release/
